    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Portfolio Block</strong> is a powerful Gutenberg block that lets you showcase your work like a professional.<br />\nEasily create portfolios with multiple layouts, category filters, responsive design, and full styling control.</p>\n<p>Perfect for freelancers, agencies, designers, photographers, or anyone showcasing projects.</p>\n<p><strong>Shortcode Supported:</strong><br />\nThis plugin also provides a <strong>shortcode</strong>, allowing you to display your portfolio <strong>anywhere</strong> on your WordPress site — including pages, posts, widgets, sidebars, footer builders, page builders, and custom templates.</p>\n<p><strong>Live Demo:</strong> https://bblockswp.com/demo/portfolio/</p>\n<h3>✨ Features</h3>\n<h3><strong>Free Features</strong></h3>\n<p>– <strong>Multiple Layouts</strong> – Grid, Masonry, and Card Hover layouts for beautiful portfolios.<br />\n– <strong>Unlimited Categories</strong> – Organize projects with unlimited categories and filter them easily.<br />\n– <strong>Portfolio Items</strong> – Add images, titles, descriptions, and links; assign multiple categories per item.<br />\n– <strong>Easy Item Management</strong> – Duplicate, delete, or reorder portfolio items with a single click.<br />\n– <strong>Responsive Layout</strong> – Works perfectly on Desktop, Tablet, and Mobile. Adjust columns and spacing easily.<br />\n– <strong>Styling Options</strong> – Control colors, borders, shadows, spacing, and overlays to match your site.<br />\n– <strong>View All Button</strong> – Add a button linking to your full portfolio with custom text and link settings.<br />\n– <strong>Shortcode Support</strong> – Use your portfolio anywhere with <code>[portfolio_block id=\"123\"]</code>.</p>\n<h3><strong>Pro Features</strong></h3>\n<p>– <strong>Advanced Layouts</strong> — Unlock Split Screen, Slider, Minimal List, and Stacked Cards layouts for a dynamic, modern portfolio.<br />\n– <strong>Enhanced Typography Controls</strong> – Full control over fonts, sizes, colors, and alignment for titles, categories, and descriptions.<br />\n– <strong>Premium Hover &amp; Animation Effects</strong> – Smooth animations and hover effects for interactive portfolios.<br />\n– <strong>Slider Options</strong> – Autoplay, infinite loop, pause on hover, and speed control for sliding portfolios.<br />\n– <strong>Advanced Styling</strong> – Extra control over button styles, badges, icons, and overlays.<br />\n– <strong>Priority Support</strong> – Get fast support and updates with the Pro upgrade.</p>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>How to Use</h3>\n<h3>Using the Block</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and activate <strong>Portfolio Block</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Open the Block Editor and click the <strong>+</strong> icon.  </li>\n<li>Search for <strong>Portfolio (by bPlugins)</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Add your portfolio items and customize your layout.  </li>\n<li>Publish your page.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Using the Shortcode</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Portfolio Block <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New Portfolio</strong> from your WordPress dashboard.  </li>\n<li>Create your portfolio using the block editor.  </li>\n<li>Publish it.  </li>\n<li>After publishing, you will see a <strong>Shortcode box</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Copy the shortcode and use it anywhere on your website where you want to show your portfolio. </li>\n</ol>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>Feedback</h3>\n<p>Have a suggestion or question?<br />\nEmail us: support@bplugins.com</p>\n<p>—</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>From the Block Editor (Gutenberg)</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Open any page or post in the WordPress Block Editor.</li>\n<li>Click the “+” Add Block icon.</li>\n<li>Search for <strong>Portfolio Block</strong>.</li>\n<li>Look for the block labeled “Portfolio (by bPlugins)” and insert it.</li>\n<li>Customize the block settings from the right sidebar and publish your page.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>From WordPress Plugin Directory</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New</strong> in your WordPress dashboard.</li>\n<li>Search for <strong>Portfolio Block</strong>.</li>\n<li>Find the plugin developed by <strong>bPlugins</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Install Now</strong>, then click <strong>Activate</strong>.</li>\n<li>Open a page and start adding your portfolio.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Upload via Plugin Installer</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <strong>portfolio-block.zip</strong> file.</li>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Upload Plugin</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select the <code>portfolio-block.zip</code> file and click <strong>Install Now</strong>.</li>\n<li>After installation, click <strong>Activate</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Manual Installation</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin ZIP file and extract it.</li>\n<li>Upload the extracted folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> using FTP or File Manager.</li>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins</strong> in your WordPress dashboard.</li>\n<li>Find <strong>Portfolio Block</strong> and click <strong>Activate</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>—</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20it%20free%3F'>\nIs it free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the core plugin is free.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20get%20the%20shortcode%3F'>\nHow do I get the shortcode?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>After publishing a portfolio under <strong>Portfolio Block</strong> and you will see a ShortCode column.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20it%20with%20page%20builders%3F'>\nCan I use it with page builders?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, all builders that support shortcodes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20all%20themes%3F'>\nDoes it work with all themes?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, fully compatible with modern WordPress themes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20customize%20layouts%20and%20styles%3F'>\nCan I customize layouts and styles?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, all settings are editable in the block editor sidebar.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20reuse%20the%20block%3F'>\nCan I reuse the block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can use it as many times as you want.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F'>\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/portfolio-block/</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='where%20do%20i%20report%20security%20bugs%20found%20in%20this%20plugin%3F'>\nWhere do I report security bugs found in this plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Please report security bugs found in the source code of the Portfolio Block plugin through the <a href=\"https://patchstack.com/database/vdp/9e5fb645-ef15-4628-91b6-de61c8ef0e78\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Patchstack Vulnerability Disclosure Program</a>. The Patchstack team will assist you with verification, CVE assignment, and notify the developers of this plugin.</p>\n<p>—</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.0 – 22 Nov 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added six new themes for improved design and customization.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4 – 16 Apr 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixes and performance improvements  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Library updates  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added external link icon  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added translation support  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>—</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create beautiful, responsive, and customizable project portfolios directly inside the WordPress block editor.",
    "description": "<p><strong>Portfolio Block</strong> is a powerful Gutenberg block that lets you showcase your work like a professional.<br />\nEasily create portfolios with multiple layouts, category filters, responsive design, and full styling control.</p>\n<p>Perfect for freelancers, agencies, designers, photographers, or anyone showcasing projects.</p>\n<p><strong>Shortcode Supported:</strong><br />\nThis plugin also provides a <strong>shortcode</strong>, allowing you to display your portfolio <strong>anywhere</strong> on your WordPress site — including pages, posts, widgets, sidebars, footer builders, page builders, and custom templates.</p>\n<p><strong>Live Demo:</strong> https://bblockswp.com/demo/portfolio/</p>\n<h3>✨ Features</h3>\n<h3><strong>Free Features</strong></h3>\n<p>– <strong>Multiple Layouts</strong> – Grid, Masonry, and Card Hover layouts for beautiful portfolios.<br />\n– <strong>Unlimited Categories</strong> – Organize projects with unlimited categories and filter them easily.<br />\n– <strong>Portfolio Items</strong> – Add images, titles, descriptions, and links; assign multiple categories per item.<br />\n– <strong>Easy Item Management</strong> – Duplicate, delete, or reorder portfolio items with a single click.<br />\n– <strong>Responsive Layout</strong> – Works perfectly on Desktop, Tablet, and Mobile. Adjust columns and spacing easily.<br />\n– <strong>Styling Options</strong> – Control colors, borders, shadows, spacing, and overlays to match your site.<br />\n– <strong>View All Button</strong> – Add a button linking to your full portfolio with custom text and link settings.<br />\n– <strong>Shortcode Support</strong> – Use your portfolio anywhere with <code>[portfolio_block id=\"123\"]</code>.</p>\n<h3><strong>Pro Features</strong></h3>\n<p>– <strong>Advanced Layouts</strong> — Unlock Split Screen, Slider, Minimal List, and Stacked Cards layouts for a dynamic, modern portfolio.<br />\n– <strong>Enhanced Typography Controls</strong> – Full control over fonts, sizes, colors, and alignment for titles, categories, and descriptions.<br />\n– <strong>Premium Hover &amp; Animation Effects</strong> – Smooth animations and hover effects for interactive portfolios.<br />\n– <strong>Slider Options</strong> – Autoplay, infinite loop, pause on hover, and speed control for sliding portfolios.<br />\n– <strong>Advanced Styling</strong> – Extra control over button styles, badges, icons, and overlays.<br />\n– <strong>Priority Support</strong> – Get fast support and updates with the Pro upgrade.</p>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>How to Use</h3>\n<h3>Using the Block</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and activate <strong>Portfolio Block</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Open the Block Editor and click the <strong>+</strong> icon.  </li>\n<li>Search for <strong>Portfolio (by bPlugins)</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Add your portfolio items and customize your layout.  </li>\n<li>Publish your page.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Using the Shortcode</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Portfolio Block <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New Portfolio</strong> from your WordPress dashboard.  </li>\n<li>Create your portfolio using the block editor.  </li>\n<li>Publish it.  </li>\n<li>After publishing, you will see a <strong>Shortcode box</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Copy the shortcode and use it anywhere on your website where you want to show your portfolio. </li>\n</ol>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>Feedback</h3>\n<p>Have a suggestion or question?<br />\nEmail us: support@bplugins.com</p>\n<p>—</p>\n",
